Scarlet Rivensin: The Ruiner is a dark, nightmarish, third person
action modification for Doom3 & Dhewm 3. The player assumes the
role of a herald of Death & fights hordes of the damned using unique
weapons, abilities and spells. dhewm 3 is a Doom 3 GPL source port,
know to work on at least Windows, Linux, Mac OS X and FreeBSD.
